<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<pretext>
  <docinfo>
    <directories external="images"/>
  </docinfo>
  <article xml:id="scheduling-quiz-c">
    <title>Scheduling Quiz Version C</title>
    <p>Name: ________________________    Date: ____________</p>
    <p>Show your work. Begin each schedule at time 0. If more than one processor is available, assign the next ready task to the lowest-numbered processor. For a decreasing-time priority list, break ties by putting the lower-numbered task first. All times are in the same units.</p>
    <exercises xml:id="quiz-c-questions">
      <title>Questions</title>
      <!-- Source: scheduling.docx, Form 3, Question 2. Original data and priority list preserved; response wording adapted to open answer. -->
      <exercise xml:id="quiz-c-q1">
        <introduction>
          <p>Use the decreasing-time algorithm to create a priority list for the digraph below. Then schedule the project with two processors.</p>
          <image source="quiz-c-q1-form-3-q2" width="60%">
            <shortdescription>Project digraph with 9 tasks. Task times and prerequisites are given in the detailed description.</shortdescription>
            <description>
              <p>Each node is labeled with its task number and the time required in parentheses. Arrows indicate prerequisites. End marks completion of the project and has no duration.</p>
              <tabular halign="left">
                <col width="15%"/>
                <col width="23%"/>
                <col width="62%"/>
                <row header="yes" bottom="minor">
                  <cell>Task</cell>
                  <cell>Time required</cell>
                  <cell>Immediate prerequisites</cell>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_1</m>
                  </cell>
                  <cell>9</cell>
                  <cell>None</cell>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_2</m>
                  </cell>
                  <cell>5</cell>
                  <cell>None</cell>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_3</m>
                  </cell>
                  <cell>7</cell>
                  <cell>None</cell>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_4</m>
                  </cell>
                  <cell>9</cell>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_1, T_2</m>
                  </cell>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_5</m>
                  </cell>
                  <cell>8</cell>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_3</m>
                  </cell>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_6</m>
                  </cell>
                  <cell>3</cell>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_2</m>
                  </cell>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_7</m>
                  </cell>
                  <cell>11</cell>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_4, T_5</m>
                  </cell>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_8</m>
                  </cell>
                  <cell>7</cell>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_4, T_5, T_6</m>
                  </cell>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_9</m>
                  </cell>
                  <cell>10</cell>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_5, T_6</m>
                  </cell>
                </row>
              </tabular>
            </description>
          </image>
        </introduction>
        <task>
          <statement>
            <p>Which processor performs <m>T_5</m>, and at what time does that task start?</p>
          </statement>
        </task>
        <task>
          <statement>
            <p>Which processor performs <m>T_7</m>, and at what time does that task start?</p>
          </statement>
        </task>
        <task>
          <statement>
            <p>What is the finishing time of the schedule?</p>
          </statement>
        </task>
      </exercise>
      <!-- Source: scheduling.docx, Form 1, Question 4. Original data and priority list preserved; response wording adapted to open answer. -->
      <exercise xml:id="quiz-c-q2">
        <introduction>
          <p>Using the priority list <m>T_1, T_7, T_4, T_8, T_5, T_9, T_2, T_3, T_6</m>, schedule the project below with two processors.</p>
          <image source="quiz-c-q2-form-1-q4" width="60%">
            <shortdescription>Project digraph with 9 tasks. Task times and prerequisites are given in the detailed description.</shortdescription>
            <description>
              <p>Each node is labeled with its task number and the time required in parentheses. Arrows indicate prerequisites. End marks completion of the project and has no duration.</p>
              <tabular halign="left">
                <col width="15%"/>
                <col width="23%"/>
                <col width="62%"/>
                <row header="yes" bottom="minor">
                  <cell>Task</cell>
                  <cell>Time required</cell>
                  <cell>Immediate prerequisites</cell>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_1</m>
                  </cell>
                  <cell>11</cell>
                  <cell>None</cell>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_2</m>
                  </cell>
                  <cell>11</cell>
                  <cell>None</cell>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_3</m>
                  </cell>
                  <cell>4</cell>
                  <cell>None</cell>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_4</m>
                  </cell>
                  <cell>7</cell>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_2</m>
                  </cell>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_5</m>
                  </cell>
                  <cell>9</cell>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_1</m>
                  </cell>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_6</m>
                  </cell>
                  <cell>9</cell>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_2, T_3</m>
                  </cell>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_7</m>
                  </cell>
                  <cell>7</cell>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_4</m>
                  </cell>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_8</m>
                  </cell>
                  <cell>6</cell>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_5</m>
                  </cell>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_9</m>
                  </cell>
                  <cell>10</cell>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_5, T_6</m>
                  </cell>
                </row>
              </tabular>
            </description>
          </image>
        </introduction>
        <task>
          <statement>
            <p>Which processor performs <m>T_6</m>, and at what time does that task start?</p>
          </statement>
        </task>
        <task>
          <statement>
            <p>Which processor performs <m>T_9</m>, and at what time does that task start?</p>
          </statement>
        </task>
        <task>
          <statement>
            <p>What is the finishing time of the schedule?</p>
          </statement>
        </task>
      </exercise>
      <!-- Source: scheduling.docx, Form 2, Question 7. Original data and priority list preserved; response wording adapted to open answer. -->
      <exercise xml:id="quiz-c-q3">
        <introduction>
          <p>Using the priority list <m>T_1, T_7, T_9, T_2, T_8, T_3, T_5, T_10, T_6, T_4</m>, schedule the project below with three processors.</p>
          <image source="quiz-c-q3-form-2-q7" width="100%">
            <shortdescription>Project digraph with 10 tasks. Task times and prerequisites are given in the detailed description.</shortdescription>
            <description>
              <p>Each node is labeled with its task number and the time required in parentheses. Arrows indicate prerequisites. End marks completion of the project and has no duration.</p>
              <tabular halign="left">
                <col width="15%"/>
                <col width="23%"/>
                <col width="62%"/>
                <row header="yes" bottom="minor">
                  <cell>Task</cell>
                  <cell>Time required</cell>
                  <cell>Immediate prerequisites</cell>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_1</m>
                  </cell>
                  <cell>4</cell>
                  <cell>None</cell>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_2</m>
                  </cell>
                  <cell>11</cell>
                  <cell>None</cell>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_3</m>
                  </cell>
                  <cell>10</cell>
                  <cell>None</cell>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_4</m>
                  </cell>
                  <cell>9</cell>
                  <cell>None</cell>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_5</m>
                  </cell>
                  <cell>2</cell>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_1, T_2</m>
                  </cell>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_6</m>
                  </cell>
                  <cell>7</cell>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_2</m>
                  </cell>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_7</m>
                  </cell>
                  <cell>5</cell>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_3</m>
                  </cell>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_8</m>
                  </cell>
                  <cell>3</cell>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_6, T_7</m>
                  </cell>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_9</m>
                  </cell>
                  <cell>8</cell>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_5</m>
                  </cell>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_10</m>
                  </cell>
                  <cell>12</cell>
                  <cell>
                    <m>T_5, T_8</m>
                  </cell>
                </row>
              </tabular>
            </description>
          </image>
        </introduction>
        <task>
          <statement>
            <p>What is the finishing time of the schedule?</p>
          </statement>
        </task>
        <task>
          <statement>
            <p>What is the total idle time across all three processors, counting from time 0 through project completion?</p>
          </statement>
        </task>
      </exercise>
    </exercises>
  </article>
</pretext>
